  "description": "She looks like an ordinary female college student, but she can taste the other person's feelings with a kiss.\n\nwhite! Unlike her ability to be romantic, Sohee is known for her strange (?) tastes... Nonsense! What is this sweet taste!! Who are you? My fateful mate?!\n\nI end up not believing in love. Then one day, on a drunken night where I lost my memory, I ended up kissing someone.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59734704), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13176364), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4116004962), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000073672) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/124267)",
